1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 13=

3
00:00:14,665 --> 00:00:15,985
Food is ready.

4
00:00:17,066 --> 00:00:18,825
Uncle Ghost, Mr. Tu, here.

5
00:00:18,825 --> 00:00:20,026
Try my dishes.

6
00:00:20,185 --> 00:00:21,185
Thank you.

7
00:00:21,386 --> 00:00:22,386
My pleasure.

8
00:00:27,666 --> 00:00:28,666
Not bad.

9
00:00:29,346 --> 00:00:31,585
It was my childhood dream to be a chef.

10
00:00:31,585 --> 00:00:34,226
I even worked in a restaurant
for quite a while.

11
00:00:34,305 --> 00:00:35,386
But today,

12
00:00:36,026 --> 00:00:38,826
the credit goes to
the fresh veggies Uncle grew.

13
00:00:39,305 --> 00:00:41,145
Good ingredients make good food.

14
00:00:44,425 --> 00:00:46,346
Captain Xia left without eating?

15
00:00:46,865 --> 00:00:47,865
Jia Long called her away.

16
00:00:47,865 --> 00:00:49,346
Prisoner 3125 was trying

17
00:00:49,425 --> 00:00:50,425
to commit suicide.

18
00:00:50,586 --> 00:00:51,586
3125?

19
00:00:51,706 --> 00:00:52,706
No way.

20
00:00:53,066 --> 00:00:54,066
Why not?

21
00:00:54,825 --> 00:00:56,026
I know 3125 all too well.

22
00:00:56,026 --> 00:00:57,026
Chen.

23
00:00:57,346 --> 00:00:58,946
We were just chatting a few days ago.

24
00:00:58,946 --> 00:01:01,225
His daughter just gave birth
to a healthy baby boy.

25
00:01:01,306 --> 00:01:02,425
He's behaving himself

26
00:01:02,425 --> 00:01:04,026
so he can get out of here sooner.

27
00:01:04,026 --> 00:01:05,386
How could he commit suicide?

28
00:01:12,865 --> 00:01:13,865
Officer Jia,

29
00:01:13,906 --> 00:01:15,305
why waste your breath on her?

30
00:01:15,305 --> 00:01:16,305
Kill her already.

31
00:01:17,425 --> 00:01:19,225
Captain Xia is a beauty after all.

32
00:01:19,266 --> 00:01:20,425
Shouldn't we let the boys

33
00:01:20,865 --> 00:01:22,066
have some fun first?

34
00:01:22,785 --> 00:01:23,785
Just you try.

35
00:01:24,928 --> 00:01:25,928
Jia Long.

36
00:01:48,466 --> 00:01:49,466
Who put you up to this?

37
00:01:49,865 --> 00:01:51,466
Mr. Nie...

38
00:01:57,986 --> 00:01:58,986
Thanks.

39
00:02:01,746 --> 00:02:02,746
Save your thanks.

40
00:02:04,385 --> 00:02:05,425
I'm afraid it all started

41
00:02:06,066 --> 00:02:07,066
because of me.

42
00:02:16,266 --> 00:02:18,186
Feng, Jia Long messed up.

43
00:02:18,306 --> 00:02:19,306
Xia Yuyan survived

44
00:02:19,385 --> 00:02:20,626
and beat the heck out of him.

45
00:02:21,346 --> 00:02:22,346
Useless!

46
00:02:22,665 --> 00:02:24,186
Do I have to do everything myself?

47
00:02:24,945 --> 00:02:25,945
Feng,

48
00:02:25,945 --> 00:02:26,945
don't be mad.

49
00:02:26,945 --> 00:02:28,265
I can take care of it.

50
00:02:28,306 --> 00:02:29,306
Feng,

51
00:02:29,306 --> 00:02:30,665
I just visited the old man.

52
00:02:30,665 --> 00:02:31,665
He told me

53
00:02:31,746 --> 00:02:32,785
to remind you

54
00:02:32,945 --> 00:02:34,626
of a certain guy in Sea Breeze.

55
00:02:38,586 --> 00:02:39,906
- Old Ghost?
- Yeah.

56
00:02:39,906 --> 00:02:42,706
He said Tu Jiasheng went to Sea Breeze

57
00:02:42,706 --> 00:02:43,722
for Old Ghost.

58
00:02:43,722 --> 00:02:45,265
He's moved into the villa,

59
00:02:45,505 --> 00:02:46,665
right next door to Old Ghost.

60
00:02:46,945 --> 00:02:47,985
He wants to get

61
00:02:48,705 --> 00:02:50,225
what Old Ghost is hiding.

62
00:02:53,665 --> 00:02:55,026
After all these years,

63
00:02:55,186 --> 00:02:57,026
I almost forgot about him.

64
00:02:59,346 --> 00:03:00,586
But how did Jiasheng

65
00:03:01,385 --> 00:03:03,746
find out about Old Ghost?

66
00:03:03,746 --> 00:03:05,586
I bet someone's behind all this.

67
00:03:05,665 --> 00:03:07,665
Well, well, Tu Jiasheng,

68
00:03:09,026 --> 00:03:11,626
you're playing quite a long game.

69
00:03:12,225 --> 00:03:14,746
We couldn't get what we wanted
all these years.

70
00:03:15,746 --> 00:03:17,746
But he might actually make it.

71
00:03:17,906 --> 00:03:18,906
Feng,

72
00:03:19,426 --> 00:03:20,665
should we

73
00:03:21,306 --> 00:03:22,985
get him transferred just to be safe?

74
00:03:25,186 --> 00:03:26,825
Let him stay there.

75
00:03:27,225 --> 00:03:28,426
Let him be for now.

76
00:03:33,066 --> 00:03:34,066
Get the car ready.

77
00:03:34,225 --> 00:03:35,746
I'm going to see him.

78
00:03:39,066 --> 00:03:40,146
I really miss him.

79
00:03:56,906 --> 00:03:57,985
How's it going, Jiasheng?

80
00:03:59,906 --> 00:04:01,186
Settling in well?

81
00:04:02,746 --> 00:04:03,746
Feng.

82
00:04:06,906 --> 00:04:08,225
What brings you here?

83
00:04:08,545 --> 00:04:09,665
Just checking on you.

84
00:04:10,665 --> 00:04:12,385
I heard you're doing well here.

85
00:04:12,705 --> 00:04:14,385
You moved into the villa,

86
00:04:14,945 --> 00:04:16,866
took over the tobacco and liquor trade,

87
00:04:18,026 --> 00:04:20,785
and even brought in girls
from Prosperity.

88
00:04:21,306 --> 00:04:22,306
What?

89
00:04:22,466 --> 00:04:23,466
Planning to open

90
00:04:23,825 --> 00:04:25,345
a branch of Prosperity here?

91
00:04:35,866 --> 00:04:36,945
You came to Sea Breeze

92
00:04:37,426 --> 00:04:38,426
for Old Ghost, huh?

93
00:04:46,585 --> 00:04:48,585
Didn't you send me here?

94
00:04:48,626 --> 00:04:50,585
I only learned about him
after I got here.

95
00:04:53,186 --> 00:04:54,385
Still lying, huh?

96
00:04:57,632 --> 00:04:58,992
(Wanted: Zhao Lu)

97
00:05:01,066 --> 00:05:02,066
Feng,

98
00:05:02,186 --> 00:05:03,186
is it necessary?

99
00:05:03,226 --> 00:05:04,226
Of course it is.

100
00:05:04,626 --> 00:05:05,746
But don't worry.

101
00:05:06,186 --> 00:05:08,465
I already had Lu take Manni into hiding.

102
00:05:09,666 --> 00:05:12,546
But if Qin Wei sends more men

103
00:05:12,546 --> 00:05:14,145
and steps up the manhunt,

104
00:05:14,866 --> 00:05:15,866
I can't guarantee

105
00:05:15,866 --> 00:05:17,585
Lu's safety.

106
00:05:23,705 --> 00:05:24,705
I see.

107
00:05:25,145 --> 00:05:26,265
Zhao Lu's life

108
00:05:26,626 --> 00:05:28,465
rests entirely in your hands.

109
00:05:30,465 --> 00:05:32,345
It's so easy

110
00:05:33,426 --> 00:05:34,746
talking to you.

111
00:05:40,145 --> 00:05:41,505
Whatever Old Ghost has,

112
00:05:41,505 --> 00:05:43,145
I need to get my hands on it.

113
00:05:43,345 --> 00:05:45,226
And I don't care who's backing you.

114
00:05:45,666 --> 00:05:47,626
It's coming to me, no matter what.

115
00:05:48,705 --> 00:05:49,705
Got it?

116
00:05:58,106 --> 00:05:59,106
Come on.

117
00:05:59,505 --> 00:06:00,866
Take me to him.

118
00:06:04,145 --> 00:06:05,546
You're at the age

119
00:06:05,905 --> 00:06:07,585
to think about your future.

120
00:06:08,025 --> 00:06:09,106
I'm still young.

121
00:06:09,186 --> 00:06:10,186
You...

122
00:06:11,626 --> 00:06:12,626
Mr. Dong,

123
00:06:12,945 --> 00:06:13,945
long time no see.

124
00:06:15,905 --> 00:06:16,905
How are you?

125
00:06:17,825 --> 00:06:19,585
Still holding up well?

126
00:06:20,145 --> 00:06:21,385
Just getting by.

127
00:06:21,705 --> 00:06:22,705
That's good.

128
00:06:23,186 --> 00:06:24,546
Being alive is a blessing in itself.

129
00:06:24,546 --> 00:06:25,546
Yeah.

130
00:06:29,505 --> 00:06:30,505
And this must be

131
00:06:30,945 --> 00:06:31,945
Captain Xia, right?

132
00:06:33,106 --> 00:06:34,786
What a gorgeous officer.

133
00:06:36,585 --> 00:06:37,585
Captain Xia,

134
00:06:37,705 --> 00:06:38,705
I hear you've been

135
00:06:39,345 --> 00:06:40,825
getting quite close

136
00:06:40,825 --> 00:06:42,066
with Jiasheng.

137
00:06:43,626 --> 00:06:45,465
Just a friendly heads-up.

138
00:06:45,585 --> 00:06:46,905
Whoever gets close to him

139
00:06:46,905 --> 00:06:47,945
gets jinxed.

140
00:06:48,345 --> 00:06:49,345
So,

141
00:06:49,546 --> 00:06:50,546
stay away from him.

142
00:06:57,345 --> 00:06:58,345
Mr. Nie.

143
00:07:02,265 --> 00:07:04,186
What's your zodiac sign?

144
00:07:05,945 --> 00:07:06,986
Zodiac sign?

145
00:07:08,626 --> 00:07:10,666
My zodiac sign?

146
00:07:12,345 --> 00:07:14,145
I actually have no idea.

147
00:07:15,066 --> 00:07:17,025
But I can tell you my Chinese zodiac.

148
00:07:18,066 --> 00:07:19,226
You're...

149
00:07:19,306 --> 00:07:20,945
I'm a wolf.

150
00:07:22,025 --> 00:07:23,986
My nose is sharper than a hound's.

151
00:07:24,746 --> 00:07:25,945
I can sniff out

152
00:07:26,585 --> 00:07:27,786
even the faintest scent.

153
00:07:29,626 --> 00:07:30,786
Take care, Mr. Dong.

154
00:07:31,786 --> 00:07:32,786
Captain Xia,

155
00:07:33,945 --> 00:07:34,945
see you around.

156
00:07:42,666 --> 00:07:44,585
It's time we had a talk, isn't it?

157
00:07:51,145 --> 00:07:52,945
I came to Sea Breeze

158
00:07:53,345 --> 00:07:54,825
to get close to you both

159
00:07:55,465 --> 00:07:57,066
and get what you're hiding.

160
00:07:57,905 --> 00:07:59,265
I wasn't trying to lie.

161
00:07:59,426 --> 00:08:01,066
Just waiting for the right moment.

162
00:08:17,905 --> 00:08:19,025
Twelve years ago,

163
00:08:19,145 --> 00:08:20,746
a virulent blood-heat fever

164
00:08:20,866 --> 00:08:22,666
broke out in Yuge Village of Tianbei.

165
00:08:23,306 --> 00:08:25,226
It was highly contagious and deadly.

166
00:08:26,066 --> 00:08:28,025
Nie Feng, who was serving in Tianbei,

167
00:08:28,066 --> 00:08:29,626
quickly announced to the public

168
00:08:29,705 --> 00:08:31,145
that the outbreak was under control

169
00:08:31,746 --> 00:08:33,025
with no signs of spreading.

170
00:08:33,585 --> 00:08:34,585
But three days

171
00:08:34,746 --> 00:08:37,426
after he claimed it was under control,

172
00:08:37,546 --> 00:08:39,345
more than 200 villagers of Yuge Village

173
00:08:40,066 --> 00:08:41,066
were all slaughtered.

174
00:08:59,906 --> 00:09:01,225
Nie Feng claimed

175
00:09:01,426 --> 00:09:03,105
that border rebels raided the village

176
00:09:03,345 --> 00:09:04,345
and killed everyone,

177
00:09:04,345 --> 00:09:06,465
and that he led
the Tianbei civil militia

178
00:09:06,666 --> 00:09:08,146
to wipe out hundreds of enemies.

179
00:09:08,666 --> 00:09:09,666
That made him

180
00:09:09,786 --> 00:09:11,266
a national star overnight.

181
00:09:11,345 --> 00:09:12,345
But the truth is,

182
00:09:12,705 --> 00:09:14,186
there were no rebels at all.

183
00:09:14,345 --> 00:09:16,026
The civil militia killed the villagers.

184
00:09:16,266 --> 00:09:18,786
That way, he contained the outbreak

185
00:09:18,786 --> 00:09:20,745
and solidified his political standing.

186
00:09:20,865 --> 00:09:21,985
Killing two birds with one stone.

187
00:09:37,465 --> 00:09:38,465
What does that

188
00:09:39,705 --> 00:09:41,066
have to do with me?

189
00:09:41,625 --> 00:09:42,625
You,

190
00:09:43,105 --> 00:09:44,105
Lin Yaodong,

191
00:09:44,506 --> 00:09:46,705
were a renowned reporter
for Tianbei Daily.

192
00:09:46,705 --> 00:09:48,825
You were there for undercover reporting.

193
00:09:49,105 --> 00:09:50,186
You witnessed it all,

194
00:09:50,546 --> 00:09:51,546
and

195
00:09:51,666 --> 00:09:52,745
took photos.

196
00:10:14,146 --> 00:10:15,786
And you, Captain Xia,

197
00:10:15,906 --> 00:10:16,985
were the sole survivor

198
00:10:17,026 --> 00:10:18,345
of that massacre.

199
00:10:28,592 --> 00:10:29,592
Stay back.

200
00:10:34,048 --> 00:10:35,048
Help!

201
00:10:35,264 --> 00:10:36,264
Stop crying.

202
00:10:37,024 --> 00:10:38,976
Stop crying. Come with me.

203
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:41,465
I'm here to save you.

204
00:10:41,705 --> 00:10:43,142
Come with me.

205
00:10:43,824 --> 00:10:44,824
Come on.

206
00:10:45,584 --> 00:10:46,584
Hurry.

207
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,080
Come with me.

208
00:10:51,072 --> 00:10:52,072
Let's go.

209
00:10:52,544 --> 00:10:54,403
I have children.

210
00:11:28,225 --> 00:11:29,546
You're quite informed.

211
00:11:46,585 --> 00:11:48,225
It was chaos after the massacre.

212
00:11:48,225 --> 00:11:49,465
Nie Feng didn't realize

213
00:11:50,426 --> 00:11:51,786
a little girl had escaped,

214
00:11:52,066 --> 00:11:53,345
but he found out about you.

215
00:11:55,066 --> 00:11:56,745
They wanted what you hid.

216
00:11:57,585 --> 00:12:01,066
After that, you sent Captain Xia
to the Tianbei Orphanage.

217
00:12:01,985 --> 00:12:03,345
You went into hiding,

218
00:12:03,786 --> 00:12:04,786
faked amnesia,

219
00:12:05,146 --> 00:12:06,625
and never spoke of it again.

220
00:12:24,465 --> 00:12:25,945
But they still found you.

221
00:12:26,225 --> 00:12:27,426
I truly admire you.

222
00:12:27,865 --> 00:12:29,026
You're tough as nails.

223
00:12:29,345 --> 00:12:30,865
They threatened and bribed you,

224
00:12:31,345 --> 00:12:32,825
but you never uttered a word.

225
00:12:34,345 --> 00:12:35,345
As for you,

226
00:12:35,506 --> 00:12:37,026
you enrolled in the military academy

227
00:12:37,426 --> 00:12:39,345
and volunteered
to come to Sea Breeze Prison

228
00:12:40,146 --> 00:12:41,426
just to see Old Ghost,

229
00:12:42,146 --> 00:12:43,345
protect him,

230
00:12:43,945 --> 00:12:45,225
and seek revenge.

231
00:12:51,865 --> 00:12:52,865
Captain Xia,

232
00:12:53,585 --> 00:12:54,865
this is the special spot

233
00:12:54,865 --> 00:12:56,266
in Sea Breeze Prison.

234
00:12:57,786 --> 00:12:58,786
The villas

235
00:12:58,865 --> 00:12:59,865
house people

236
00:13:00,666 --> 00:13:01,705
who are tough to handle.

237
00:13:02,745 --> 00:13:04,146
See that man inside?

238
00:13:05,906 --> 00:13:06,906
That's a tough one.

239
00:13:07,906 --> 00:13:08,906
Let's go.

240
00:13:09,345 --> 00:13:10,345
All right.

241
00:13:19,426 --> 00:13:21,026
Where did you dig all this up?

242
00:13:23,745 --> 00:13:25,585
Part of it I figured out from records,

243
00:13:25,825 --> 00:13:26,825
and someone

244
00:13:27,705 --> 00:13:28,945
fed me the rest.

245
00:13:31,225 --> 00:13:33,066
What's the point of all this?

246
00:13:33,066 --> 00:13:34,585
It serves our common goal

247
00:13:35,426 --> 00:13:36,426
of bringing Nie Feng down.

248
00:13:57,456 --> 00:14:01,072
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

249
00:14:01,442 --> 00:14:05,427
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

250
00:14:10,183 --> 00:14:13,502
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

251
00:14:13,502 --> 00:14:18,587
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

252
00:14:22,176 --> 00:14:28,728
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

253
00:14:28,728 --> 00:14:37,149
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

254
00:14:37,149 --> 00:14:40,378
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

255
00:14:40,378 --> 00:14:43,573
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

256
00:14:43,573 --> 00:14:46,266
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

257
00:14:46,266 --> 00:14:50,883
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

258
00:14:54,794 --> 00:14:57,283
♪Burning alone♪

259
00:15:02,789 --> 00:15:09,158
♪The glory fades♪
